DESCRIPTION:Gravitate back to Morehead Planetarium for Star Families!\n\n \
 n\nIn this immersive planetarium experience\, you'll learn to identify the
  constellations\, stars\, and planets best seen this summer before "liftin
 g off" Earth and into the universe.\n\n \n\nStar Families is a special ser
 ies that provides an immersive\, family-friendly planetarium experience. A
 rrive before your show or stay after to journey through Morehead's interac
 tive exhibits\, science demo spaces\, and Cosmic Goods gift shop.\n\n \n\n
 This program is recommended for families and children ages 7+.
