CATEGORIES:Dance Performance
CATEGORIES:Festival/Fair
CATEGORIES:Main
CONTACT;X-BEDEWORK-UID=8a000483-92c3adf6-0196-4a1f0d98-00002aac:Rodeffer\,
  Heidi
X-BEDEWORK-COST:$30–$45 (discounts available)
CREATED:20260501T211649Z
DESCRIPTION:Presented in collaboration with Turnbridge Equities • ADF Comm
 issioned World Premiere\nProgram: New works by Ephrat Asherie\, Vincent E
 . Thomas\, & Keith Thompson\nRunning time: 60-75 minutes\, with potential
  intermission\nTickets: $30-$45\nTickets are purchased through Duke Unive
 rsity's Box Office.\n\nThe Footprints program bridges ADF's performance a
 nd education series\, featuring four ADF-commissioned world premieres by 
 renowned choreographers and performed by ADF students.  This year's chore
 ographers are Ephrat Asherie\, Stephan Koplowitz\, Vincent E. Thomas\, an
 d Keith A. Thompson. Asherie is a New York City-based choreographer\, per
 former\, b-girl\, and a "Bessie" award winner for Innovative Achievement 
 in Dance. She creates dynamic\, rhythm-driven work for the dancers of her
  company\, Ephrat Asherie Dance. Koplowitz is a multidisciplinary artist 
 whose 40-year career spans site-specific and concert dance-theater\, inte
 ractive media installations\, film\, and photography. His large-scale sit
 e works transform public spaces and invite communities to experience plac
 es in new ways. Thomas is a choreographer\, dancer\, and teacher and the 
 Artistic Director of VTDance. His work blends contemporary dance\, improv
 isation\, text\, and cross-disciplinary collaboration with artists across
  mediums. Thompson is a choreographer\, director\, and multifaceted conte
 mporary dance artist. He serves as Assistant Director of Dance and Associ
 ate Professor in the School of Music\, Dance and Theatre at Arizona State
  University.\n\n\nDon't miss a FREE site-specific performance by Stephan 
 Koplowitz as a part of this year's Footprints program at Mutual Tower!\nS
 aturday\, July 11 at 1 pm & 3 pm\nSunday\, July 12 at 11 am & 1 pm\n\nPho
 to Credit: Mohamed Sadek\, Whitney Browne\, Lynn Lane\, Lauren Castellana
 \n_________\n\nADF offers a 20% discount to Duke employees and $20 ticket
 s to Duke students (restrictions apply). To access your discount\, just l
 og in with your Duke Net ID at tickets.duke.edu.
DURATION:PT1H15M
DTSTAMP:20260501T211750Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260711T193000
LAST-MODIFIED:20260501T211750Z
LOCATION;X-BEDEWORK-UID=18832edc-1b27e154-011b-28097e74-0000000d:Bryan Cen
 ter Reynolds Industries Theater
STATUS:CONFIRMED
