SUMMARY:Durham Geek and Grub Market (Anime Edition)
DESCRIPTION:Come out and join us for the ANIME Edition of the Geek and Grub Market at the Durham Armory! This fun and FREE event features 40+ geektastic vendors\, food trucks\, special guests and fun activities. \nBegin your adventure at our check-in desk at the main entrance of the building\, where little geeks can receive a free goodie from our treasure chest or find out how to participate in our free scavenger hunt. Refresh at our Geek Tavern with a selection of non-alcoholic geektastic beverages. \nEVENT FAQs\nDo I need a ticket for Entry? No ticket required for this Geektastic journey! \nWhere do I Park? There is tons of street parking (free on weekends) and paid parking in nearby garages. \nWill there be food and drinks? There will be food trucks plus there will be non-alcoholic themed mocktails at our indoor Geek Tavern. \nHow Does the Scavenger Hunt Work? Find 8 of our ANIME Gambits and return to the HQ Desk to win a prize! \nHow Do I Become a Vendor at this Event? Apply at vend at this event at GeekandGrubMarket.com. \nIs this event handicapped accessible? Absolutely! The event is fully accessible! \nCan We View Vendors Ahead of Time? Yes! Ten days before our event\, simply visit our website to view the vendor list and map before the event. \nAre Pets Welcome at this Event? Only service dogs will be able to attend this event – but feel free to bring them to our next event at Optimist Farm in Apex!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/durham-geek-and-grub-market-anime-edition/
LOCATION:Durham Armory\, 212 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC
CATEGORIES:Festival,Free
