SUMMARY:Durham Fight for Justice Lit Drop Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260712T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260712T143000
DTSTAMP:20260712T033906Z
UID:4g9i468ek1dsjrkv5998b0dc0d@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260712T123000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260610T021555Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join FLIP NC Super Volunteers Lisa and Sarah for a lit drop
  party and happy hour meet up at Motorco Parts &amp\; Labor in downtown Du
 rham! We'll meet up at 12:30pm\, have a bite (on us!) and drinks\, distrib
 ute materials and lit drop information\, and head out to drop lit for abou
 t an hour. Then we'll meet back up at Motorco Parts &amp\; Labor after for
  drinks.</p><p>Volunteers will have the option to go out in pairs or on th
 eir own. Sign up a friend to join you\, or we'll pair you up when you arri
 ve.</p><p>For this voter outreach event\, we're leaving informational flye
 rs at targeted\, left-leaning voters' doors to spread the word about the r
 ight-wing takeover of our state courts and the importance of voting the fu
 ll ballot in November.</p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/flipnc/event
 /969648/"><strong>Sign up here!</strong></a><strong> Note: Advance sign-up
  is needed so we know how many flyers and voter lists to prepare.</strong>
 </p><p>Hope to see you there!</p><br><br><a href="https://flipnc.org/event
 s/2026/7/12-durham-lit-drop-party">https://flipnc.org/events/2026/7/12-dur
 ham-lit-drop-party</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T021555Z
LOCATION:723 Rigsbee Ave\, Durham\, NC 27701\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
