UID:10002850-1783965600-1783974600@www.transitionslifecare.org
SUMMARY:Grief Summer Studio Series: Memory Buddies
DESCRIPTION:Create a Memory Buddy in honor of your loved one! Participants will select and personalize a plush companion with memories\, hopes\, and wishes\, creating a meaningful\, huggable keepsake. All supplies are provided\, and participants are invited to bring memory items such as buttons\, jewelry\, or fabric from home to personalize their buddy. \nChildren and teens are welcome to register with a participating adult. \nGroup starts promptly at 6:00pm and end time is flexible. The studio will remain open until 8:30pm. Drop-in pizza dinner at 5:30pm \nRegistration is limited\, please call 919-719-7199 to reserve your space.
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/grief-summer-studio-series-memory-buddies/
