 on!\n\n🕺 Social Dancing | 8:30–11:30 PM\n🎧 DJ Giovanni spinning Sa
 lsa\, Bachata & Latin hits\n\n🔥 Drink specials all night!\n\n❄️ Air
 -conditioned venue\n🪩 Spacious dance floor\n\n💲 $10 B4 9pm (Early bi
 rd special) online at salsa4life.com or at the door.\n$15 after 9pm!\n\n
 📍 KōMANA Brewing Co. 1020 Ryan Rd\, Cary\, NC\n\n🚗 Free parking\n
 🔞 18+ to party | 21+ to drink\n\nGrab your friends and make Wednesdays 
