SUMMARY:Triangle Tech Net
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Tech Net\n**Triangle Tech Net: Your Next Big Move Sta
 rts Here.**\nThe Triangle’s fastest-growing tech networking event is bac
 k — and we’re turning up the energy.\n\nWhether you're eyeing your nex
 t career move or searching for top-tier talent\, *this* is where the Trian
 gle's tech ecosystem comes to connect\, collaborate\, and create real oppo
 rtunities.\n\nJuly 17th\, 2026\n7:30–9:30 AM\n**No entry will be permitt
 ed after 8:15 AM**\n6501 Weston Parkway\, Suite #300\, Cary\, NC 27513\nBu
 siness Casual\n\n**What's In It For You:**\n**Direct Access to Decision Ma
 kers** — Meet hiring managers\, recruiters\, tech leaders\, and peers fa
 ce-to-face.\n**Actionable Insights** — Learn what’s working *right now
 * in hiring\, career moves\, and talent acquisition.\n**Off-Market Opportu
 nities** — Discover jobs\, partnerships\, and connections you won’t fi
 nd posted online.\n**Real Community** — Build a network that actually wo
 rks for you.\n**This isn’t a coffee-and-business-card swap. It’s your 
 chance to move the needle.**\n\nAdmission is free — but space fills fast
 . Reserve your spot today.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ttn-rtp/events/315368494/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260622T142428Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260622T142428Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
