X-SOURCE-ID:ncwf
X-SOURCE:NC Wildlife Federation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T233000
DTSTAMP:20260711T233935
CREATED:20260708T161453Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260708T161454Z
UID:10001671-1784404800-1784417400@ncwf.org
SUMMARY:Moth Madness & Movie Night (Chapel Hill)
DESCRIPTION:Visit NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter at Moth Madness and Movie Night at the Chapel Hill Public Library! The evening will begin with a screening of The Extraordinary Caterpillar which explores the ecological role of caterpillars. After the film\, participants will migrate outside for crafts\, games\, and activities with local environmental organizations in addition to moth night viewing in the park! Join us for an event celebrating our moth friends! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/moth-madness-movie-night-chapel-hill/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Naturalsciences": "https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/mothing-for-science-2026/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:naturalsciences
X-SOURCE:NC Museum of Natural Sciences
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T233000
DTSTAMP:20260711T233929
CREATED:20260612T001401Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T001401Z
UID:122375-1784406600-1784417400@www.naturalsciences.org
SUMMARY:Mothing for Science
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge require registration during construction. Register here \nCelebrate National Moth Week with the Museum at Prairie Ridge! Enjoy a brief orientation in the outdoor classroom\, then head out to our blacklights to see what’s out and about throughout the night. Bring a flashlight\, a camera (if you have one)\, and your moth questions. We’ll have activities for all\, Moth Bingo (with prizes!) for everyone\, and information for how you can share your data to help scientists learn more about the species in our area. You’ll walk away with basic identification guides you can use for your own moth adventures! \nThis program is for ages 8 and up and all children under 16 must be accompanied by a registered adult.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/mothing-for-science-2026/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Collaborative Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens,Walk-up Programs
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Goforth":MAILTO:chris.goforth@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.812182885871;-78.713963528554
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Prairie Ridge 1671 Gold Star Drive Raleigh NC 27607 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1671 Gold Star Drive:geo:-78.713963528554,35.812182885871
END:VEVENT
