DESCRIPTION:Carolina Federation<br> <br><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/
 downhomenc/event/562891/">https://www.mobilize.us/downhomenc/event/562891/
 </a> <br><br>Join us this phone bank in inviting folks to come to the Joh
 nston County commissioners meeting on May the 18th! <br><br>Virtual traini
