SUMMARY:NHBA Bird Outing
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T100000
DTSTAMP:20260712T033936Z
UID:4btlpu1ihdn31u68lvbo68suk0@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T070000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260626T154804Z
DESCRIPTION:For questions\, contact Vern Bothwell at <a href="mailto:vernb
 2017@gmail.com" target="_blank">vernb2017@gmail.com</a>. The location will
  be Flat River Waterfowl Impoundment\, about 0.4 miles north of Jock Road
 . The coordinates are 36.127667\, -78.832790.\n\nThis outing is sponsored 
 by the New Hope Bird Alliance (formerly New Hope Audubon).\n\nOutings usua
 lly last 2-3 hours. No reservations or sign-up needed. If there is a large
  turnout for any particular outing\, we may split into two groups. We do r
 ecommend carpooling for families or friend pods\; while we love pets\, the
 re is a ‘no-pet’ policy for bird outings. New birders and birders of a
 ll skill levels are welcome. \n\nPlease wear long pants\, socks\, and stur
 dy shoes (ticks and chiggers may be present). Sun and bug protection are a
 lso recommended. Bring snacks and water if you like. Heavy rain will resul
 t in cancellation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260626T154804Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:New Hope Bird Alliance
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Woke Wednesdays: North Durham
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T073000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T083000
DTSTAMP:20260712T033906Z
UID:65jh9jvfsnn18ge9mkcp67emkd@google.com__20260722
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260108T022109Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Wednesday at
  N. Roxboro &amp\; Latta in North Durham from 7:30-8:30am. There is a CVS 
 that opens at 8am. There is also other convenient parking.\n\nThis will be
  a POSITIVE and nonviolent demonstration. We are here to protect our democ
 racy. We are standing up for what we believe in. We want to inspire people
  to join us and grow our movement!\n\nPlease bring positive signs supporti
 ng the movement and resisting what is happening in our country!\n\nPlease 
 no mocking signs\, no swastikas\n\nWe are excited to see you there and sta
 nd together for our country!\n\nSee you every Wednesday morning engaging d
 rivers in Durham!\n\nPlease join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google
