BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/managing-data-writing-and-publishing-your-review-class-6-of-8-in-the-systematic-review-summer-workshop-series"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260712T033737Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52940882514835
DTSTART:20260722T160000Z
DTEND:20260722T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Launch your systematic review with free summer series! \n\n \n\
 nInterested in conducting a systematic review? The Health Sciences Library
 ’s Systematic Review Summer Workshop Series will get you started in eigh
 t bite-sized sessions. Sign up for all of them\, or just the ones you need
 . \n\n \n\nThis free virtual series will provide researchers with tools an
 d resources to confidently navigate the systematic review process.  \n\n \
 n\nWho should attend? \n\n \n\nThis series is intended for individuals and
  research teams who are planning to conduct a systematic literature review
  or want more information about systematic reviews. It is also relevant fo
 r those conducting scoping reviews or other similar evidence synthesis pro
 jects. No prior knowledge or experience with systematic reviews is require
 d. The instruction is aimed toward health reviews\, but open to anyone at 
 UNC-Chapel Hill or the UNC Medical Center.   \n\n \n\nWhat will be covered
 ? \n\n \n\nWe’ve broken down the systematic review process from ideation
  through publication into eight one-hour lessons. Each lunchtime session r
 uns on Wednesdays from noon to 1 p.m. \n\n \n\nJune 10 - Introduction to S
 ystematic Review Methods \n\nJune 17 - What Type of Review Should You Choo
 se? \n\nJune 24 - Project Management and Helpful Tools for Conducting Syst
 ematic Reviews \n\nJuly 8 - Literature Searching for Systematic Reviews \n
 \nJuly 15 - Introduction to Covidence \n\nJuly 22 - Managing Data\, Writin
 g and Publishing your Review \n\nJuly 29 - Predictive Artificial Intellige
 nce and Automation Tools
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Managing Data\, Writing and Publishing your Review (Class 6 of 8 in
  the Systematic Review Summer Workshop Series)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/managing-data-writing-and-publ
 ishing-your-review-class-6-of-8-in-the-systematic-review-summer-workshop-s
 eries
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/overcoming-negative-thinking"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260712T033737Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53083388573194
DTSTART:20260722T160000Z
DTEND:20260722T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Have you had an argument with your spouse or significant other 
 that impacted your whole day? Maybe you had thoughts like\, “I’m such 
 a jerk\,” or\, “All we do is fight.” Have you ever been stuck in tra
 ffic thanks to an accident? Maybe you said to yourself\, “I knew I shoul
 dn’t have gone this way\,” or\, “This always happens to me.” State
 ments like these are common reactions to scenarios in our lives\, but they
  are inaccurate and distort the way we see ourselves and the world around 
 us. This session will examine the 10 Cognitive Distortions and how they im
 pact our mood and create faulty beliefs about ourselves and the world arou
 nd us. Through examining these distortions\, we will identify ways to chal
 lenge negative thoughts and limit the impact they have on our lives.\n\nCl
 ick on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Request” butt
 on to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Overcoming Negative Thinking
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/overcoming-negative-thinking
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
