X-SOURCE-ID:triangleland
X-SOURCE:Triangle Land Conservancy
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T110000
DTSTAMP:20260602T192104Z
CREATED:20260602T151341Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260602T192104Z
UID:10000081-1784883600-1784890800@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Trail Talks with TLC: Brumley North
DESCRIPTION:Get a special look at TLC's work on this staff led hike series!\nJoin TLC Grants Manager\, Laura Warman\, and Working Lands Manager\, Emma Childs\, on an exploration of Brumley North Nature Preserve. Learn about the forest ecology within the various habitats of Brumley that have made this preserve a popular spot for birders\, hikers\, bikers\, and naturalists! This is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nInclement Weather Policy: In the event of inclement weather\, you will be contacted by email for a call on cancellation or postponement.\n\nCurrent Mask Policy: TLC seeks to build a supportive\, mask-friendly environment in all collaborations with staff and the public. Please wear a mask if you are not vaccinated\, or if that makes you feel most comfortable. We also encourage those eligible to be vaccinated to get their Covid-19 vaccine and booster shot. If you are experiencing any Covid-related symptoms\, please stay home and attend a program another day. Our top priority is to create a safe environment for our community. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/trail-talks-with-tlc-brumley
LOCATION:Brumley North Nature Preserve\, 3620 Old State Highway 10\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Triangleland": "https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-forest-detectives"}
X-SOURCE-ID:triangleland
X-SOURCE:Triangle Land Conservancy
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260724T110000
DTSTAMP:20260629T145637Z
CREATED:20260429T231245Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629T145637Z
UID:10000066-1784885400-1784890800@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Nature Storytime: Forest Detectives
DESCRIPTION:Become a Forest Detective at our monthly Nature Storytime!\nEngage your sense of smell\, sight\, sound\, and wonder! This month’s story time will invite everyone to learn about the cycles and secrets of nature through nature stories\, nature games\, and a short ramble through the Williamson Nature Preserve trails. Join a TLC educator for this monthly story series where you can meet other families in your community and learn about nature. This month's nature stories are: "All Around Us" By Xelena Gomez and "Beneath" by Cori Doerrfeld. This program is designed for kids age 3-7 and their grownups. Please register all members of the family attending\, including children and adults:\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please email Meera Butalia at mbutalia@triangleland.org to be added to the waitlist.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-forest-detectives
LOCATION:Williamson Farm and Nature Preserve\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, 27610\, United States
END:VEVENT
