SUMMARY:Come Play Games at Gizmo
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\nCome play games at Gizmo!\n\n59
 07 Triangle Dr\, Raleigh\, NC 27617\n\nGizmo is inviting us in for game ni
 ghts onJuly 20th and July 27th. If it is well attended we can make this a 
 weekly event starting in July.\n\nOne of the organizers will try and get t
 here early and we will bring a couple of totes of games\; however\, if the
 re is something you want to play please bring a copy.\n\nI'm not sure what
  the exact list will be\, but I know I'll bring Codesnames\, Wizard\, and 
 a couple of other staples. I'm trying to get a good list of games to inclu
 de and would love to hear your ideas. Just leave them in the comments and 
 I'll bring what I can.\n\nThanks\,\nLance
