 9/</a>\n\nHow to join:\nThank you for signing up! Here are some notes befo
 re the phone bank.\n\nThis phone bank will be easier if you are **not doin
 g everything on your phone or tablet**\, we recommend you use two devices\
 , preferably a phone and a computer\, and we highly recommend you join us 
 at home or in a quiet area. \n\nWe will be using Scale to Win to make call
 s. \n\n**Please click this link and [watch a quick training on how to use 
 Scale to Win](<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.co
 m/watch?v%3DcMqsfqpHPvU).**&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\
 ;usg=AOvVaw1ZJCUBnLh8N9RATcgWNNok" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com
 /watch?v=cMqsfqpHPvU).**</a>\n\nJoin Common Cause for an important phone b
 ank as we mobilize voters to take action against dangerous legislation in 
 state houses around the country. We will focus on the most urgent campaign
 s that need our help. Some of these campaigns may include stopping bills t
 hat will make it harder for millions of Americans—especially students\, 
 seniors\, and veterans—to cast their ballots. We need your help to ensur
 e voters across the country call their state representatives and demand th
 ey protect the freedom to vote.\n\nNo prior experience is necessary—our 
 team will provide full training at the start of each shift!\n\n## What to 
 Expect:\n\n* A step-by-step walkthrough of our Phone Dialer tools.\n* Expe
 rt tips on effective communication with voters.\n* Opportunities to ask qu
 estions and connect with other like-minded volunteers.\n\n\nSign up today 
 and take the first step toward empowering voters and protecting democracy 
 in 2025!\n\nHow to prepare:\nThank you for signing up! Here are some notes
  before the phone bank.\n\nThis phone bank will be easier if you are **not
  doing everything on your phone or tablet**\, we recommend you use two dev
 ices\, preferably a phone and a computer\, and we highly recommend you joi
 n us at home or in a quiet area. \n\nWe will be using Scale to Win to make
  calls. \n\n**Please click this link and [watch a quick training on how to
  use Scale to Win](<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtu
 be.com/watch?v%3DcMqsfqpHPvU).**&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2
 &amp\;usg=AOvVaw1ZJCUBnLh8N9RATcgWNNok" target="_blank">https://www.youtub
 e.com/watch?v=cMqsfqpHPvU).**</a>\n\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q
 =https://www.mobilize.us/commoncause/event/758610/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=c
 alendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3pBvbHNAVmlsk15nR97rtw" target="_blank">
 https://www.mobilize.us/commoncause/event/758610/</a>
