DESCRIPTION:QRSI 2026 (Qualitative Research Summer Intensive) from Research
 Talk is a premier\, week-long training program for researchers\, co-hosted
  with UNC's Odum Institute\, offering intensive\, expert-led courses in qu
 alitative research methods\, theory\, and data analysis\, with options for
  foundational to advanced topics\, including using AI\, grounded theory\, 
 and developing practical skills for various disciplines.
