 every Monday at Dacian Avenue and Washington Street in Durham from 4:30-5:
 30pm.  There is convenient parking.\n\nThis will be a POSITIVE and nonviol
 ent demonstration. We are here to protect our democracy. We are standing u
 p for what we believe in. We want to inspire people to join us and grow ou
 r movement!\n\nPlease bring positive signs supporting the movement and res
 isting what is happening in our country!\n\nPlease no mocking signs\, no s
 wastikas\n\nWe are excited to see you there and stand together for our cou
 ntry!\n\nSee you every Monday afternoon engaging drivers in Durham!\n\nPle
 ase join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://subst
 ack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sou
 rce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMPWcPPUFQih9k" target="_bl
 ank">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy<
 /a>\n\nFor more ED4D Mobilize Events: <a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;sour
 ce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xqNbFip0P6DfK4plFB1D7" target="_bla
 nk">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/</a>\n\n<a href="h
 ttps://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemo
 cracy/event/881585/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOv
 Vaw378iK-fMke1wiDVlCIgtjt" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engaged
 efendersfordemocracy/event/881585/</a>
