DESCRIPTION:<span><p>Come join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Tuesd
 ay from 7:30-9 on the bridge overpass of 1-147 and Anderson Drive. We are 
 there to demonstrate in defense of our democracy and the rights of all in 
 this country. We are for raising the minimum wage\, housing for all\, heal
 thcare for all\, protecting the earth\, and protecting our workers. Come a
 ny time during this time. We have a mighty crew who comes each week. Thank
  you activism warriors for your dedication!!</p><p>Parking at Erwin Square
  Plaza on Rutherford — about 3 blocks walking\, slightly up hill. You ca
 n google Duke University Federal Credit Union (2200 W Main St\, Durham\, N
 C 27705).</p><p>See you every Tuesday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pede
 strians in Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="
 https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">http
 s://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p
 >For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobiliz
 e.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefenders
 fordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfo
 rdemocracy/event/840890/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocr
 acy/event/840890/</a> </p></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T223205Z
LOCATION:I-147 Overpass @ Anderson Street\, 121 Anderson St\, Durham\, NC\
 , 27705
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
