 kets are shifting. Workforce dynamics are evolving. New opportunities are 
 emerging while new challenges are reshaping how organizations plan for the
  future. The question is simple: Is your business ready for what's next? J
 oin the Greater Durham Chamber of Commerce on Wednesday\, August 5\, from 
 11:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. at the PNC Triangle Club at Durham Bulls Athletic 
 Park for one of the most anticipated business events of the year\, our Mid
 -Year Economic Outlook. The key to ensuring all of our residents and busin
 esses benefit from our growing economy is understanding its drivers and op
 portunities. Join us at our Mid-Year Economic Outlook to learn more about 
 Durham's economic development efforts and how we are all sharing in the gr
 owth. This isn't just another luncheon. It's where business leaders\, deci
 sion-makers\, entrepreneurs\, investors\, nonprofit leaders\, and communit
 y stakeholders come together to gain the knowledge needed 
