BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Durham Chamber of Commerce": "https://members.durhamchamber.org/events/details/rtp-3-0-lunch-learn-reimagine-the-park"}
X-SOURCE-ID:durham_chamber
SUMMARY:RTP 3.0 Lunch & Learn: Reimagine the Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T100000
UID:64370af708a1408fc14c983bbb264f58@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Research Triangle Park (RTP) is entering its next chapter. As 
 workplace trends\, talent expectations and regional growth continue to res
 hape how people live and work\, RTP 3.0 provides a framework to ensure RTP
  remains a globally competitive center for innovation for decades to come.
  Join the Research Triangle Foundation of North Carolina (Foundation) for 
 RTP 3.0 Lunch & Learn: Reimagine the Park sponsored by McAdams and LS3P\, 
 the Park's long-range vision and recently approved land use framework desi
 gned to support continued innovation\, economic growth and investment. Thi
 s session will provide a detailed discussion of RTP 3.0’s new developmen
