 racy/event/841392/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvV
 aw3b-d5FofmPq5VM3C7ztbph" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engagede
 fendersfordemocracy/event/841392/</a>
