SUMMARY:"Women Together" Yoga & Wellness (Summer) Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nJoin us for the next quarterly **"Wome
 n Together" Yoga & Wellness (Summer) Retreat! Theme: 'The Space Between (A
 ntara)'.** **Payment of $90 due at signup to hold your spot.**\n\n* Venmo 
 @Darlene-Genander (0982 if asked)\n* Paypal [dgenander@yogainnature.com](m
 ailto:dgenander@yogainnature.com "mailto:dgenander@yogainnature.com")\n* Z
 elle\n\nA women's retreat that will show you how to find that precious spa
 ce ‘in-between' for YOU to find peace as we slow the pace in this evenin
 g retreat. We will drop into nature and the season of Summer at Sky Pond a
 s we become aware of the transitions on and off our mat\, and of this seas
 on.\n\n* slow vinyasa flow to yin yoga and meditation (open to all levels 
 and beginners)\n* nature immersion and nature walk\n* connections and conv
 ersations with other women who share similar interests\n* journaling or dr
 awing… your creative process\n* light nourishing meal\; seasonal cold te
 as\n* wellness gift to support your growth journey\n\nNOTE: We will practi
 ce yoga outdoors in front of the pond\, weather permitting. If it is too h
 ot\, we will have our yoga practice indoors.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/yogainnaturenc/events/315289585/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260616T215915Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260616T215915Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
