DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Thursday at 
 Broad &amp\; Main Street Durham NC. Near Whole Foods &amp\; Duke's East Ca
 mpus<br><br>This will be a POSITIVE and nonviolent protest. We are here to
  protect our democracy. We are standing up for what we believe in. We want
  to inspire people to join us and grow our movement!<br><br>Please bring p
 ositive signs opposing the Oligarchy<br><br>Please no mocking signs\, no s
 wastikas<br><br>We are excited to see you there and stand together for our
  country!<br><br>See you every Thursday from 4:30-5:30 engaging drivers in
  Durham!<br><br>Please join our Substack: <a href="https://substack.com/@
 engageddefendersfordemocracy?utm_source=global-search" target="_blank">htt
 ps://substack.com/@engageddefendersfordemocracy?utm_source=global-search</
 a><br><br>For more ED4D Mobilize Events:  <a href="https://www.mobilize.
 us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/842805/" target="_blank">https://www.
 mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/</a><br> <br><a href="https
 ://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/842805/">https://www.
 mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/842805/</a>
