 bers and guests in a relaxing atmosphere.What to Expect: No Charge to Atte
 nd: Bring your business cards\, a friend\, and great ideas Brew Connection
 s: Meet and chat with local entrepreneurs\, community leaders\, and the bu
 siness community Sponsor Spots: No Cost to Sponsor! We ask scheduled spons
 ors to provide a breakfast snack/treat and a raffle or two Registration is
  appreciated\, and all are welcome! For sponsorship interest or general qu
 estions please email: julie@wakeforestchamber.org
