X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/loneliness-and-social-isolation-in-todays-world-3755"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20260712T033737Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53107568420091
DTSTART:20260826T160000Z
DTEND:20260826T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Despite living in a world with instant electronic access to fri
 ends\, family and all manner of online social networks\, the rates of repo
 rted loneliness and social isolation have been steadily increasing.\nLonel
 iness and social isolation substantially impact not only psychological wel
 l-being but physical health as well. Loneliness is now considered a health
  risk factor on par with cigarette smoking. This training will address the
  possible reasons for loneliness and identify actions participants can tak
 e to increase their emotional connection with others and decrease the risk
  of social isolation.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Loneliness and Social Isolation in Today’s World
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/loneliness-and-social-isolatio
 n-in-todays-world-3755
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
