UID:10000092-1787907600-1787914800@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Trail Talks with TLC: Old Creedmoor
DESCRIPTION:Aerial view of Old Creedmoor Preserve by Emilia Brennan \nGet a special look at TLC's work on this staff led hike series!\nJoin TLC Associate Land Manager\, Umar Muhammad on an exploration of our newest Wake County nature preserve! Umar will point out the various tree species at Old Creedmoor Nature Preserve\, which protects 65 acres of pristine forest habitat and critical streams! Old Creedmoor's trails are built for mountain biking in mind\, so there is variable terrain with potential tripping hazards and other features that can pose difficulty for some participants.   This is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\nInclement Weather Policy: In the event of inclement weather\, you will be contacted by email for a call on cancellation or postponement.
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/trail-talks-with-tlc-old-creedmoor
LOCATION:Old Creedmoor Nature Preserve\, 13509 Old Creedmoor Rd\, Wake Forest\, NC\, 27587\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Triangleland": "https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-curious-crawlers"}
X-SOURCE-ID:triangleland
X-SOURCE:Triangle Land Conservancy
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260828T110000
DTSTAMP:20260629T215714Z
CREATED:20260629T215714Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629T215714Z
UID:10000086-1787909400-1787914800@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Nature Storytime: Curious Crawlers
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a bug-tastic Nature Storytime! \nEnter the teeny tiny world of insects and learn what makes them so special! Come learn about our creeping\, crawling\, fluttering friends with nature stories\, nature games\, and a short ramble through the forest. Join us at the Brumley Nature Playspace for this monthly story series where you can meet other families in your community and learn about nature. This month's stories are: An Extraordinary Ordinary Moth by Karlin Gray and Butterflies are Pretty Gross by Rosemary Mosco. This program is designed for kids age 3-7 and their grownups. This is a free event\, but please register all members of the family attending\, including children and adults: 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/nature-storytime-curious-crawlers
LOCATION:Brumley South Nature Preserve\, 3055 New Hope Church Rd\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
END:VEVENT
