DESCRIPTION:Durham County’s “I Take Testing Seriously” Program (ITTS
 ) works with community partners and members alike to decrease rates of HIV
 \, Syphilis\, Hepatitis C\, Gonorrhea\, and Chlamydia. Our public health e
 ducators provide comprehensive sexual health services anywhere in Durham C
 ounty."\n\nWhen folx attend testing services through the LGBTQ Center of D
 urham\, they are able to receive: Free and confidential HIV/STI screenings
 \, PrEP referrals as needed\, and confidential counseling on next steps.\n
 \nAccess to free barriers (internal\, external) and lubrication is always 
 readily available.\n\nOur tester can also answer questions about PREP and 
 provide initial steps in the County's Quick Start program for PREP. Stop i
 n today!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260522T234105Z
LOCATION:114 Hunt St\, Durham\, NC 27701\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
