SUMMARY:Tour: Curators’ Tour of "Continental Shift" and "Care and Concern"
DESCRIPTION:Join Peter Nisbet\, deputy director for curatorial affairs\, and Lauren Turner\, associate curator for contemporary art for this tour of both exhibitions. \nIn this tour\, the curators of both Continental Shift and Care and Concern: Recent Acquisitions of Contemporary Art discuss the ways that the recently-acquired works of art exhibited affect the Museum’s collection of African and contemporary art. \nFree\, but space is limited; registration required below. This event is part of UNC–Chapel Hill’s Campus Life Experience (CLE) program. Students who attend can scan the QR code provided at the event to receive CLE credit.
