DESCRIPTION:Hosted by the Wake Forest Area Chamber in partnership with the
  Town of Wake Forest. Join us for the 2026 Candidate Forum\, the region's 
 largest public forum dedicated to connecting voters with the candidates se
 eking to represent our community. This event serves as the community's lar
 gest opportunity to hear directly from candidates running in races that im
 pact our region. Community members\, business leaders\, and residents are 
 invited to attend\, learn about the candidates\, and gain insight into the
  perspectives shaping our local and regional future. The forum is designed
  to foster meaningful discussion while giving each candidate the opportuni
 ty to clearly communicate their priorities and ideas. While not structured
  as a traditional debate\, the format encourages thougthful exchange betwe
 en candidates. Each candidate will respond to moderated questions\, follow
 ed by opportunities for rebuttal and response\, creating a dynamic convers
 ation that allows attendees to hear differing viewpoints a
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
