DESCRIPTION:Durham County’s “I Take Testing Seriously” Program (ITTS
 ) works with community partners and members alike to decrease rates of HIV
 \, Syphilis\, Hepatitis C\, Gonorrhea\, and Chlamydia. Our public health e
 ducators provide comprehensive sexual health services anywhere in Durham C
 ounty.<br><br>When folx attend testing services through the LGBTQ Center o
 f Durham\, they are able to receive: free and confidential HIV/STI screeni
 ngs\, PrEP referrals as needed\, and confidential counseling on next steps
 .<br><br>Specimens are sent to the NC State Lab  for testing where a 4<s
 up>th</sup> generation test is used.<br><br>Access to free barriers (inte
 rnal\, external) and lubrication is always readily available.<br><br>Our t
 ester can also answer questions about PrEP and provide initial steps in th
 e County's Quick Start program for PrEP. Stop in today!<br><br>Are you not
  ready to test? Stop in for an informational session.  All questions welc
 ome.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260703T135630Z
LOCATION:114 Hunt St\, Durham\, NC 27701\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
