DESCRIPTION:Join horticulture staff and experienced volunteers on a walk around the Blomquist Garden of Native Plants to learn about connections between people\, plants and place. Each month will feature a different seasonal topic related to gardening with native plants. \nFee: $10; free for Duke Gardens members with discount code. \nParking: Parking fees apply. \nLocation: Meet at the gatehouse entrance to the Blomquist Garden of Native Plants (location 202 on the Gardens map). \nAccessibility: This is a small group program that takes place outdoors\, traveling on gravel paths with some uneven surfaces\, moderate inclines and stairs.
