DESCRIPTION:<br>Hey! Do you like to ride your bike on Wednesdays?<br><br>C
 ome hang out &amp\; ride bikes each 1st and 3rd Wednesday of the month at 
 a casual paced no-drop social ride. 10-15 miles in a loop around Chapel Hi
 ll/Carrboro. Mostly on paved surfaces. We'll end at food/beer.<br><br>Meet
  at 6:45-7pm at the Bicycle Chain on Franklin St in Chapel Hill. Roll out 
 at 7:15 (dm if ur late).<br><br>Don't forget lights and anything else you 
 may need (helmet\, water\, spare tube\, multitool\, bananas\, a friend\, a
  waffle iron\, spare derailleur hanger\, space blanket\, whatever).<br><br
 >Let's party! ✨ see you there<br><br><br><a href="https://www.instagram.
 com/p/CwsilayOvwP/"><u>https://www.instagram.com/p/CwsilayOvwP/</u></a>
